# The repo has core.autocrlf=true, which would rewrite these files to CRLF on
# checkout. That would break the whole point of this directory: the mirror is meant to
# be byte-identical to the live files under ~/.openclaw/workspace so it can be copied
# straight back, and sync-workspace-custom.py compares them by sha256 (a line-ending
# rewrite would make every file report as CHANGED forever).
#
# -text disables all end-of-line conversion here. Scoped to this directory on purpose:
# a repo-wide setting would renormalize unrelated tracked files.
* -text
